  "content": "<div class=\"-mb-2\"><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/n2rfi5l4oe_img1.jpg\" alt=\"Head Image\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; margin-right: 10px;\"><strong>哥飞</strong></div>\n<div>🔗 <a href=\"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTIzMzYyMA==&amp;mid=2650081764&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=94606e7cb5348382f39984175c85aaba&amp;chksm=bf3f38df8848b1c9050584f56cf75e7545233961567c3543e638fe87a7180c2ae0784a48dcfd&amp;mpshare=1&amp;scene=1&amp;srcid=0103HQDGY2tpMVjn5uvQuNSE&amp;sharer_shareinfo=271835d2431e2b422023d9cbe8183bf4&amp;sharer_shareinfo_first=271835d2431e2b422023d9cbe8183bf4#rd\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">【哥飞观察】分享一个月收入240万美元且最近流量暴涨的产品</a></div>\n<div>我们先看下 SensorTower 估算的 App 收入数据，iOS 月收入200万美元，Android 月收入40万美元，加起来就是240万美元的​月收入。</div>\n<hr class=\"h-2 my-2\">\n<div class=\"-mb-2\"><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/n2rfi5l4oe_img1.jpg\" alt=\"Head Image\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; margin-right: 10px;\"><strong>哥飞</strong></div>\n<div>最后一小点付费部分，跟大家分享下。\n打开 Semrush 看反链。</div>\n<hr class=\"h-2 my-2\">\n<div class=\"-mb-2\"><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/n2rfi5l4oe_img1.jpg\" alt=\"Head Image\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; margin-right: 10px;\"><strong>哥飞</strong></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/n2rfi5l4oe_img2.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<hr class=\"h-2 my-2\">\n<div class=\"-mb-2\"><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/n2rfi5l4oe_img1.jpg\" alt=\"Head Image\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; margin-right: 10px;\"><strong>哥飞</strong></div>\n<div><a href=\"https://www.mydealz.de/gutscheine/blinkist-com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.mydealz.de/gutscheine/blinkist-com</a></div>\n<blockquote>\n<div>哥飞</div>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/n2rfi5l4oe_img2.jpg\" alt=\"引用图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n</blockquote>\n<hr class=\"h-2 my-2\">\n<div class=\"-mb-2\"><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/n2rfi5l4oe_img1.jpg\" alt=\"Head Image\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; margin-right: 10px;\"><strong>哥飞</strong></div>\n<div>不太了解老外的习惯，但是从流量数据来看，在 mydealz.de 上面卖新人可用的优惠券，是很有效的拉新方式。</div>\n<hr class=\"h-2 my-2\">\n<div class=\"-mb-2\"><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/n2rfi5l4oe_img3.jpg\" alt=\"Head Image\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; margin-right: 10px;\"><strong>Heaven</strong></div>\n<div>mydealz是德国的什么值得买</div>\n<hr class=\"h-2 my-2\">\n<div class=\"-mb-2\"><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/n2rfi5l4oe_img1.jpg\" alt=\"Head Image\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; margin-right: 10px;\"><strong>哥飞</strong></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/n2rfi5l4oe_img4.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<hr class=\"h-2 my-2\">\n<div class=\"-mb-2\"><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/n2rfi5l4oe_img1.jpg\" alt=\"Head Image\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; margin-right: 10px;\"><strong>哥飞</strong></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/n2rfi5l4oe_img5.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<hr class=\"h-2 my-2\">\n<div class=\"-mb-2\"><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/n2rfi5l4oe_img1.jpg\" alt=\"Head Image\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; margin-right: 10px;\"><strong>哥飞</strong></div>\n<div>懂了</div>\n<blockquote>\n<div>Heaven:mydealz是德国的什么值得买</div>\n</blockquote>\n<hr class=\"h-2 my-2\">\n<div class=\"-mb-2\"><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/n2rfi5l4oe_img3.jpg\" alt=\"Head Image\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; margin-right: 10px;\"><strong>Heaven</strong></div>\n<div>一些比较极致的用户会到这类型的网站去看他们的deals优惠， 德国这个站点特别多技术宅，男性用户占比很高，他们很喜欢在mydealz蹲电脑办公的优惠，比如显卡，显示屏，手机</div>\n<hr class=\"h-2 my-2\">\n<div class=\"-mb-2\"><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/n2rfi5l4oe_img6.jpg\" alt=\"Head Image\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; margin-right: 10px;\"><strong>HelloLeo</strong></div>\n<div>这是有在德国待过的经历？</div>\n<blockquote>\n<div>Heaven:一些比较极致的用户会到这类型的网站去看他们的deals优惠， 德国这个站点特别多技术宅，男性用户占比很高，他们很喜欢在mydealz蹲电脑办公的优惠，比如显卡，显示屏，手机</div>\n</blockquote>\n<hr class=\"h-2 my-2\">\n<div class=\"-mb-2\"><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/n2rfi5l4oe_img3.jpg\" alt=\"Head Image\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; margin-right: 10px;\"><strong>Heaven</strong></div>\n<div><span title=\"[偷笑]\" class=\"wx-emoji\" style=\"display: inline-block;background: url(data:image/png;base64,) no-repeat;width: 20px;height: 20px;background-size: 20px;\"></span>去欧洲出过差，和这些人打过交道。</div>\n<hr class=\"h-2 my-2\">\n<div class=\"-mb-2\"><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/n2rfi5l4oe_img3.jpg\" alt=\"Head Image\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; margin-right: 10px;\"><strong>Heaven</strong></div>\n<div>比较了解欧洲的流量和开发者生态</div>\n<hr class=\"h-2 my-2\">\n<div class=\"-mb-2\"><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/n2rfi5l4oe_img6.jpg\" alt=\"Head Image\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; margin-right: 10px;\"><strong>HelloLeo</strong></div>\n<div>商务大佬<span title=\"[666]\" class=\"wx-emoji\" style=\"display: inline-block;background: url(data:image/png;base64,) no-repeat;width: 20px;height: 20px;background-size: 20px;\"></span></div>\n<hr class=\"h-2 my-2\">\n<div class=\"-mb-2\"><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/n2rfi5l4oe_img7.jpg\" alt=\"Head Image\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; margin-right: 10px;\"><strong>Dylan</strong></div>\n<div>也不是，很多人现在习惯都是买之前找deal</div>\n<hr class=\"h-2 my-2\">\n<div class=\"-mb-2\"><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/n2rfi5l4oe_img7.jpg\" alt=\"Head Image\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; margin-right: 10px;\"><strong>Dylan</strong></div>\n<div>所以现在deal站也是好的渠道</div>\n<hr class=\"h-2 my-2\">\n<div class=\"-mb-2\"><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/n2rfi5l4oe_img3.jpg\" alt=\"Head Image\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; margin-right: 10px;\"><strong>Heaven</strong></div>\n<div>他们做这个coupon code主要是丰富社区提供折扣的形态，也可以吃到搜索的流量，因为老外购物之前会搜 XXX promo code， 比如 amazon promo code</div>",
